DESCRIPTION:Raise a glass to Petaluma’s newly-certified Green Businesses
  Join us for a celebratory happy hour honoring the local business leaders 
 from Cool Petaluma’s 2026 Green Biz Cohort who have just earned Californ
 ia Green Business Certification. Cohort members include businesses from ac
 ross Petaluma—from restaurants and retailers to service providers and cr
 eatives. Whether you’re a Cool Business Collective member\, curious abou
 t getting certified\, or simply want to connect with others who care about
  sustainability\, this is a great chance to meet the businesses leading th
 e way. Come celebrate\, show your support\, and get your questions answere
 d about the certification process. FREE and open to all #block-2bfa92a9f86
